<?xml version="1.0"?>
<package xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/packaging/2012/06/nuspec.xsd">
  <metadata>
    <id>NLog</id>
    <version>4.4.0-alpha1</version>
    <authors>NLog</authors>
    <owners>NLog</owners>
    <licenseUrl>http://raw.github.com/NLog/NLog/master/LICENSE.txt</licenseUrl>
    <projectUrl>http://nlog-project.org/</projectUrl>
    <iconUrl>http://nlog-project.org/N.png</iconUrl>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description>NLog is a logging platform for .NET with rich log routing and management capabilities. It can help you produce and manage high-quality logs for your application regardless of its size or complexity. This package installs NLog.dll with includes core logging functionality. For your main project also need to install 'NLog Configuration' package.</description>
    <summary>NLog - Advanced .NET and Silverlight Logging</summary>
    <releaseNotes>Added CoreCLR support.

Note! Not all unit tests are succeeding in dnxcore50 yet. This package is not ready for production!

Xamarin is also not available yet, use NLog 4.3.0 for Xamarin Support. 

Please give feedback about CoreCLR to https://github.com/NLog/NLog/issues/641</releaseNotes>
    <tags>logging log tracing logfiles NLog database eventlog email wcf coreclr</tags>
    <dependencies>
      <group targetFramework=".NETFramework3.5" />
      <group targetFramework="DNX4.5.1" />
      <group targetFramework="DNXCore5.0">
